  "document": "Vincent Janssen\nVincent Petrus Anna Sebastiaan Janssen (born 15 June 1994) is a Dutch professional footballer who plays as a striker for Fenerbahçe on loan from Premier League club Tottenham Hotspur and the Netherlands national team. He was awarded the 2016 Johan Cruyff Trophy, the Dutch \"Talent of the Year\" award."
